				<p><s coords="1,100.00,270.00,400.00,9.00">Transformers <ref type="bibr" coords="1,160.00,270.00,12.00,9.00" target="#b0">[1]</ref> changed sequence modelling.</s><s coords="1,100.00,281.00,400.00,9.00">Two works study retrieval <ref type="bibr" target="#b1">[2,</ref><ref type="bibr" target="#b2">3]</ref>.</s><s coords="1,100.00,292.00,400.00,9.00">
	Earlier results <ref type="bibr">[9]</ref> are disputed.</s></p>
				<p><s coords="1,100.00,303.00,400.00,9.00">As Smith et al. <ref type="bibr" target="#b2">(2020)</ref> note, see <ref type="figure" target="#fig_0">Figure 1</ref> and <ref type="url" target="https://github.com/example/claims">our code</ref>.</s></p>
